# GLOBAL UI ELEMENTS

## Toast Notifications — bottom right — always on top

  STATE success → [bg green] [Icon ✓] "Message here" [fade in slide up → 3s → fade out slide down]
  STATE error → [bg red] [Icon ✗]
  STATE warning → [bg yellow] [Icon ⚠]
  STATE info → [bg blue] [Icon ℹ]
  multiple toasts → stack vertically with 8px gap

## Modals — global

  backdrop → [bg black 60% opacity — fade in]
  modal → [scale 0.8→1.0 + fade in — 200ms ease-out]
  close:
    ↓ click backdrop → modal: scale 1.0→0.8 + fade out + backdrop fade out
    ↓ click ✕ → same
    ↓ Escape key → same
    ↓ backdrop click attempt when [ConfirmModal no-dismiss] → backdrop pulses 3px shake

## Page Transitions

  [NavItem] click →
    current content: slide right 30px + fade out [150ms]
    new content: slide from left 30px → 0 + fade in [200ms]
    [TopBar title]: fade swap [100ms]
    [NavItem] active indicator: slides vertically to new item

## Loading States

  button submitting → text hides + [Spinner small white inline] + button disabled
  table loading → shimmer rows [bg gradient left→right animated]
  card loading → shimmer rectangles
  page loading → [ProgressBar thin green — top of viewport — 0→100%]

## Sidebar Collapsed State (small screens)

  sidebar → hidden off-screen left
  [HamburgerIcon ☰ — top left TopBar]
  ↓ click → [Drawer slides in from left over content — backdrop]
    same nav items
    ↓ click nav → drawer slides out + navigate
    ↓ backdrop click → drawer slides out

## Responsive Card Layout (small screens)

  4-col stat cards → 2-col
  3-col plan cards → 1-col scroll
  table → card-per-row stacked view
  side panel → collapses below main panel
